WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Step 1. In Family Record Editor -> Guardians, select the intended guardian.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Step 2. Confirm the personal email and phone are correct.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Step 3. Confirm Parent portal login is selected and save the parent record.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Step 4. Verify the result reports that the parent portal login is ready or the guardian displays Portal linked.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Step 5. Scroll to Parent Portal Access.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Step 6. Select Send Parent App Invite for a new guardian or Resend Parent App Invite for an already linked guardian.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Step 7. Confirm the email status is Accepted. Delivered is a separate status that confirms delivery.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Step 8. Use Send Parent Feature Guide & FAQ only after the guardian is linked.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:21.533
Step 9. Tell the parent to use the personal guardian email from the profile at https://thebeesuite.io/parents.

00:01:21.533 --> 00:01:30.533
Verify the result. Verify the exact guardian is linked; distinguish email accepted from delivered.

